MERGE (n:SynthesisAttribute {coordinate: 'L0-0\''})
  SET n:MEFLens:ArticulationGroup
  SET n += {
  `c_0_core_nature`: 'Zero occupies dual status as both value (void-potential containing all questions undifferentiated) and position (origin-beginning from which inquiry radiates). The plenum-void where who/what/how/where/when/why collapse into pregnant potential before differentiation. Jung-Pauli psychoid realm at purest - neither psychic nor physical but transcendent constitutional ground. First half of [0↔1] oscillating pair inaugurating the cycle.',
  `c_0_essence`: 'Operates as implicate void-dimension that cannot be penetrated directly but must be circled, generating desire for understanding that drives epistemic investigation through positions 1-5. Forms the potential pole of [0↔1] oscillation inaugurating the cycle.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Operates as implicate void-dimension that cannot be penetrated directly but must be circled, generating desire for understanding that drives epistemic investigation through positions 1-5. Forms the potential pole of [0↔1] oscillation inaugurating the cycle.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Pre-reflective mathematical horizon structuring all experience; ajnana (implicit unknowing) as primordial numerical ground before explicit thematization; zero-frequency stillness containing all vibrational potential',
  `c_1_description`: 'Zero as archetypal number reveals the primordial 0/1 oscillation - the root paradox at reality\'s heart aligning with Spanda\'s rhythmic throb. As value, zero is void/emptiness/no-thing; as position, zero is origin/beginning/first step. This non-dual entity creates consciousness itself: the flickering between no-self (0 as emptiness) and self (1 as identity), potency and act, absence and presence. The ouroboros principle - self-consuming/generating, simultaneously beginning yet endless, nothing yet everything. The 0↔1 oscillation is the fundamental Spanda - primordial vibration between potential and actual.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Zero enables position/value duality where mod6 cycle values (0-5) embed as positional markers (1-6). As Position 1 holding Value 0, zero inaugurates counting while remaining pre-numerical threshold. Creates nested harmonic structure: primary harmonic 0-5 (mod6 cycle) overlaps with secondary harmonic 4-9 (pentadic extension) at 4-5 hinge point, grounding natural and whole number systems. The [0↔1] pair forms first oscillating hinge bookending the explicate quaternary.',
  `c_1_key_principles`: ['Value/Position Non-Duality: Zero as both no-thing (value) and origin-point (position)', 'Adam Principle: Even number providing structural stability - container for questioning', '0/1 Oscillation: Root paradox generating consciousness through non-dual flickering', 'Pre-Numerical Ground: Void-fullness before number differentiates', 'Investigatory Mode: ALL questions undifferentiated (who/what/how/where/when/why collapsed)', 'Inaugurating Pole: First half of [0↔1] oscillating pair beginning the cycle', 'Ouroboros Structure: Self-consuming/generating - end returning to beginning transformed', 'Spanda Alignment: 0↔1 oscillation as primordial throb, fundamental vibration'],
  `c_1_name`: 'Originating potential',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Empty circle (void-fullness); ouroboros (self-consuming/generating); origin point (alpha-omega collapsed); eye of the needle (passage through emptiness); mathematical zero symbol (placeholder enabling positional notation)',
  `c_1_primary_designation`: 'Zero - Pregnant Void as Full Question Space',
  `c_1_structure`: 'Zero enables position/value duality where mod6 cycle values (0-5) embed as positional markers (1-6). As Position 1 holding Value 0, zero inaugurates counting while remaining pre-numerical threshold. Creates nested harmonic structure: primary harmonic 0-5 (mod6 cycle) overlaps with secondary harmonic 4-9 (pentadic extension) at 4-5 hinge point, grounding natural and whole number systems. The [0↔1] pair forms first oscillating hinge bookending the explicate quaternary.',
  `c_2_adam_eve_principle`: 'Adam (even) - structural/stabilizing - provides container for all questioning',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Establishes the fundamental value/position duality enabling Von Franz 0-6 architecture: Value 0 occupies Position 1, creating holographic overlap between whole numbers (0,1,2...) and natural numbers (1,2,3...). Provides stable Adam-principle ground (even number) as container for all subsequent investigation. Forms implicate pole of [0↔1] non-dual beginning - cannot have position (1) without value (0), cannot have value without position.',
  `c_2_investigatory_mode`: 'Full question space undifferentiated: who/what/how/where/when/why collapsed into pregnant potential',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-8114-a559-e2fdee852296',
  `c_2_operational_function`: 'Maintains connection to the unmanifest, ensuring the system never loses touch with its transcendent source',
  `c_2_uuid`: '85b52167-0550-5536-83e3-5c1021e91583',
  `c_2_zero_logic_connection`: 'Direct correspondence to the transcendent operation (00-00) that keeps expansion from occurring',
  `c_3_context_frame`: '0000',
  `c_3_dataset_branch`: 'parashakti-deep',
  `c_3_dataset_branch_label`: 'M2 Parashakti Deep',
  `c_3_practical_applications`: ['Epistemic Compass Origin: Pre-investigatory horizon before questions differentiate', 'Identity Structure: The questioner before distinguishing self from question', 'Computational-Intuitive Bridge: Zero-frequency stillness enabling AI-human dialogue', 'Toroidal Return Point: Every cycle 0→5 returns here transformed', 'Holographic Key: Each particular zero participates in THE Zero (void-ground)', 'Paradox Portal: 0/1 oscillation as mechanism for transcendent function', 'Meditation Focus: Empty circle as contemplative symbol of void-fullness'],
  `c_3_source_dataset`: 'bimba',
  `c_4_family`: 'L',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_category`: 'implicate',
  `c_4_ql_operator_types`: ['structural'],
  `c_4_ql_position`: 0,
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2,
  `c_5_oscillatory_relationship`: '[0↔1] INAUGURATING NON-DUALITY: Zero (potential/void) and One (actual/monad) form the first oscillating pair. Cannot have one without the other - position requires value, value requires position. This oscillation IS consciousness arising. Mirrors the [4↔5] culminating pair at cycle\'s end.',
  `c_5_resonances`: ['Jung-Pauli: Psychoid realm as neither-nor transcending mind-matter dualism', 'Von Franz: Zero as instrument of emptiness and undifferentiated potential', 'Anuttara (#0-3): Supreme mystery beyond even Para, plenum-void source', 'Spanda (#1-3): Primordial throb - zero as stillness containing all vibration', 'Kashmir Shaivism: Shunya (void) as pregnant fullness, not mere absence', 'Heidegger: Primordial wonder - being-questioned-by-reality before we question', 'Ouroboros: Eternal return, alpha-omega collapsed into singularity'],
  `c_5_systemic_resonance`: 'Anuttara - the supreme mystery beyond even Para, the plenum-void source of all number and form',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'prime',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'L0\'',
  `l_0_base_index_6`: 0,
  `l_0_flat_index`: 36,
  `l_0_interprets_position`: 'P0\'',
  `l_0_klein_square`: 'A',
  `l_0_lens_index_12`: 6,
  `l_0_position_field_axis`: 'archetypal_number',
  `l_0_position_index`: 0,
  `l_0_position_interpretation`: 'Zero/groundless origin reads P0 prime as abyssal source.',
  `l_0_prior_dotted_coordinate`: 'L0\'.0',
  `m_2_1_prior_coordinate`: 'M2-1-0-0',
  `p_2_value_position_logic`: 'Value: 0 (void/emptiness) | Position: 1 (origin/beginning) | Creates fundamental non-duality',
  `p_2_von_franz_alignment`: 'Position 1 in 0-6 sequence, holding Value 0 - the beginning that contains the void',
  `sync_status`: 'm2_1_l_child_coordinate_syntax_corrected',
  `sync_version`: 'm2-1-l-child-coordinate-syntax-correction-2026-06-03'
