MERGE (n:SynthesisAttribute {coordinate: 'L2-4'})
  SET n:MEFLens
  SET n += {
  `c_0_core_nature`: 'The fourth logical position: "X neither is nor is not the case" - double negation, apophatic theology at full intensity, transcendence of binary altogether. This DENIES BOTH affirmation and negation without falling into simple agnosticism. Following Pseudo-Dionysius and Eckhart: God is NEITHER being NOR non-being - beyond ontological binary. This is boundary where logic meets ineffable. CONTEXTUAL dimension of logic\'s limit - WHERE and WHEN framework applies/fails. First pole of [4↔5] oscillating culmination.',
  `c_0_essence`: 'Operates as fourth explicate logical position completing quaternary while revealing limits - nesting system through contextual boundary recognition. Forms contextual pole of [4↔5] oscillation in logic.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Operates as fourth explicate logical position completing quaternary while revealing limits - nesting system through contextual boundary recognition. Forms contextual pole of [4↔5] oscillation in logic.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Transcendent consciousness; awareness beyond assertion and denial; the "neither-nor" of ineffability',
  `c_1_description`: '"Neither" completes tetralemma\'s exhaustive coverage of logical space. Nagarjuna uses this for reductio ad absurdum - showing all four positions fail for certain questions reveals those questions are wrongly formulated. The famous Buddhist "silence" - neither affirming nor denying - operates here. Tetralemma\'s fourth corner - threshold of inexpressibility. CRITICAL: This is WHERE system nests itself - recognizing its own limits. Position 4 creates CONTEXTUAL AWARENESS of logic\'s applicability domain - the CONDITIONS under which logical framework works. Enables Position 5\'s transcendent synthesis by grounding framework\'s bounds.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Organized as double negation: "Neither" rejects both affirmation and negation, transcending the binary without collapsing into nothing. Via negativa absoluta. Contains recognition of logical limit without abandoning logic - acknowledging where concepts fail to capture reality. The "not-this-not-that" completing quaternary while pointing beyond it.',
  `c_1_key_principles`: ['Via Negativa Absoluta: Negating both affirmation and negation', 'Beyond Binary: Transcending is/is-not framework', 'Apophatic Completion: Where logic meets its limit', 'Neither-Nor: Double negation without nihilism', 'Logical Humility: Recognizing where categories fail', 'System Nesting: Framework revealing its own bounds', 'When/Where Answer: Contextual limits of logical applicability'],
  `c_1_name`: 'Transcendence (neither is nor is not)',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Empty set (∅); closed hand (neither giving nor taking); horizon line (limit of vision); silence (absence of speech); void (no-thing)',
  `c_1_primary_designation`: 'Transcendence (Neither) - Contextual Limit of Logic',
  `c_1_recursive_structure`: '',
  `c_1_structure`: 'Organized as double negation: "Neither" rejects both affirmation and negation, transcending the binary without collapsing into nothing. Via negativa absoluta. Contains recognition of logical limit without abandoning logic - acknowledging where concepts fail to capture reality. The "not-this-not-that" completing quaternary while pointing beyond it.',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Fourth explicate position in tetralemma - contextual recognition that some realities EXCEED logical capture. "Neither" is not nihilism but humility - acknowledging where categories fail. This is quaternary\'s completion - having exhausted affirmation (1), negation (2), and synthesis (3), we recognize LIMIT of conceptual operation. NESTS THE SYSTEM by revealing logical framework\'s contextual bounds. Mirrors Level 0\'s archetypal four - CONTEXTUAL grounding. Forms contextual pole of [4↔5] non-dual pair in logic.',
  `c_2_has_nested_reflection`: true,
  `c_2_logical_bifurcation`: 'LOGIC BIFURCATES LIKE FINAL CAUSE: CONTEXTUAL LIMIT (Position 4): WHERE and WHEN does logical framework apply? Recognition of framework\'s boundaries - the situational constraints. Nesting function - seeing system\'s applicability domain. TRANSCENDENT SYNTHESIS (Position 5): WHY does logical investigation matter ultimately? The purposeful gnosis beyond positions. Meaningful response transcending framework. Together they form complete logical realization: Context (#4) shows WHERE logic ends. Transcendence (#5) shows WHY logic matters.',
  `c_2_madhyamika_core`: 'Neither existence nor non-existence - the middle way',
  `c_2_mystical_implication`: '',
  `c_2_nesting_function`: '',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-81ed-87a0-c7029e041bf4',
  `c_2_recursive_nesting`: true,
  `c_2_uuid`: 'cd9e0f26-80c7-5f5a-8a08-d1153a9ee8c2',
  `c_2_vertical_implication`: 'VERTICAL RESONANCE: Just as archetypal four creates contextual dimension and contextual final cause provides situational conditions, contextual limit reveals logic\'s applicability bounds. Each level\'s Position 4 provides that level\'s contextual grounding.',
  `c_2_zero_logic`: 'Indeterminacy (0/0) - the undefined that opens infinite possibility',
  `c_3_context_frame`: '0000',
  `c_3_dataset_branch`: 'parashakti-deep',
  `c_3_dataset_branch_label`: 'M2 Parashakti Deep',
  `c_3_practical_applications`: ['Apophatic Mysticism: Neither this nor that in meditation', 'Logical Analysis: Recognizing when questions fail', 'Silence Practice: Noble silence beyond assertion/denial', 'Boundary Recognition: Identifying limits of conceptual frameworks', 'Nesting Systems: Frameworks recognizing their own bounds', 'Ineffability Respect: Honoring what cannot be captured', 'Context Awareness: When/where does logical framework apply?'],
  `c_3_source_dataset`: 'bimba',
  `c_4_family`: 'L',
