  SET n:MEFLens
  SET n += {
  `c_0_energetic_nature`: 'Vital force breaking through resistance',
  `c_0_epii_form_essence`: 'Form as living process rather than dead structure. Where formatted container receives dynamic content through active forming-into. Not passive filling but self-organizing vibrational patterns maintaining themselves through resonance.',
  `c_0_essence`: 'First emergence - the breakthrough into manifestation',
  `c_1_description`: 'Sprouting represents the first visible emergence of the process - when potential breaks through into actuality. This is the moment of greatest vulnerability and greatest vitality. The seed must crack open, the sprout must push through darkness toward light. It embodies the value-driven impulse (feeling) that provides energy for transformation.',
  `c_1_epii_form_concrescence_mapping`: 'Whiteheadian Physical Prehension / Dynamic Content: The vibrating fullness, the channels filled with flowing currents. Consciousness differentiating into dynamic self-organizing patterns.',
  `c_1_epii_form_designation`: 'Dynamic Content Shaping From Within: In-formation (hyphenated intentionally) captures information (Shannon-Weaver encoded patterns), in-forming (continuous shaping activity), and forming-into (ongoing transformation).',
