MERGE (n:SynthesisAttribute {coordinate: 'L3-5'})
  SET n:MEFLens
  SET n += {
  `c_0_epii_form_essence`: 'Form achieving self-consciousness. All previous stages happen to form or through form; only at re-form does form become capable of examining and transforming itself. Consciousness recursively applied to consciousness—the strange loop enabling genuine creativity and evolution.',
  `c_0_essence`: 'Distilled wisdom - the eternal extracted from the temporal',
  `c_1_description`: 'Maturity represents both completion and new beginning - the fruit that contains next season\'s seeds. This is where the temporal process yields eternal value. What Whitehead calls "objective immortality" - the aspects of the process that contribute to ongoing reality. The distilled essence becomes available for new cycles, ensuring evolution rather than mere repetition.',
  `c_1_epii_form_concrescence_mapping`: 'Whiteheadian Objective Immortality / Contribution to Future: Performance outcomes feed back into templates. Completed occasions contribute data to future processes. The universe learning about itself through repeated cycles.',
  `c_1_epii_form_designation`: 'Recursive Transformation and Evolution: Re-form introduces reflexivity and recursion. Forming again with wisdom gained from previous cycle. Not mechanical repetition but evolutionary spiral.',
  `c_1_epii_form_etymology`: 'Latin *re-* (\'again, back, anew\', from PIE *wret- \'to turn\') + *form*. Forming again; transforming; recursive self-modification; evolutionary return.',
  `c_1_epii_form_loop_structure`: 'Re-form creates loop back to pro-forma. After complete performance, return to template level with accumulated wisdom. Pro-forma template enriched by memory of actual performances. This is learning, evolution, development.',
  `c_1_epii_form_subsystem_resonance`: '',
  `c_1_epii_form_three_semantic_dimensions`: 'Reform (social improvement), Re-form (recursive repetition at higher level), Transform (implicit potential for change while maintaining essence). The 5→0 Möbius twist.',
  `c_1_epii_form_word`: 'Re-form',
  `c_1_name`: 'Maturity (synthesis/renewal)',
  `c_2_generative_function`: 'Ensures each cycle contributes to cosmic learning',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-81f4-a0fa-e62b89102c70',
  `c_2_uuid`: '83d6142b-b75e-50bd-bc8b-5d473a7bb459',
  `c_2_wisdom_teaching`: 'True completion plants seeds for the future',
  `c_3_context_frame`: '0000',
  `c_3_dataset_branch`: 'parashakti-deep',
  `c_3_dataset_branch_label`: 'M2 Parashakti Deep',
  `c_3_source_dataset`: 'bimba',
  `c_4_family`: 'L',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_category`: 'implicate',
  `c_4_ql_operator_types`: ['structural'],
  `c_4_ql_position`: 5,
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2,
