  `l_0_prior_dotted_coordinate`: 'L5.3',
  `m_2_1_prior_coordinate`: 'M2-1-5-3',
  `p_2_philosophical_position`: 'Bhedabheda (Unity-in-Difference) with Difference Emphasis - seeing the one through the many; recognizing how diversity patterns itself toward unity; synthesis emerging from differentiation; both-and with structure focus',
  `q_2_divine_archaeology_gesture`: '',
  `q_2_kriya_sakti_preparing`: 'Action-Power (Kriyā) gathering itself - not yet acting but poised to act. The archer drawing the bow, the dancer preparing to leap. Potential energy at maximum before release into kinetic manifestation. The \'about-to\' moment where everything is structured but nothing yet moves.',
  `q_2_prakasa_vimarsa`: '',
  `q_2_siva_sakti_play`: 'The mediating dance where Śakti structures what Śiva intuits. Kriyā Śakti (Action-Power) preparing for manifestation. The blueprint stage where vision becomes plan, inspiration becomes design. Like musical composition - notes chosen, harmonies structured, rhythm patterned, before the orchestra plays.',
  `q_2_spanda_nature`: '',
