MERGE (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'S'})
  SET n:Stack
  SET n += {
  `artifact_kind`: 'vault_canvas',
  `c_0_core_nature`: 'Root coordinate branch for the Epi-Logos technical-procedural stack across S0 through S5.',
  `c_1_description`: 'Root coordinate branch for the Epi-Logos technical-procedural stack across S0 through S5.',
  `c_1_form`: 'Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/S/S.canvas',
  `c_1_name`: 'S Technical Stack',
  `c_1_structure`: '{"authority_spec":"docs/specs/S/S-STACK-INTEGRATION.md","layer_name":"technical-stack","promotion_contract":"s-branch-live-promotion-v1"}',
  `c_4_artifact_role`: 'definition',
  `c_4_family`: 'S',
  `c_4_layer`: 'S-root',
  `content_hash`: 'sha256:1ffcaf53c6e1c2959ae0f009fa36f04f3559671bdde27ef3bcacead3723a2f02',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'direct',
  `coordinate_depth`: 1,
  `coordinate_prefix`: 'S',
  `promotion_source`: 'pi_agent',
  `q_0_runnable_horizon`: 'Before S can stack anything, something must already demand that conception become RUNNABLE — that ontology cash out as actual process, actual persistence, actual I/O. S presupposes the # inversion act and the raw archetypes #0–#5 (CLAUDE.md II.A–B) which it does not contain but manifests; it is the Layer-2 technology-stack descent of a foundation it does not author. Its thrown ground is the bare fact of the machine: that there is silicon, a filesystem, a process table, a socket — a substrate that will accept commands and return exit codes whether or not any meaning has yet been assigned to them. This is the void-pole S lives upon, and it is the most concrete void in the whole coordinate space: not the abyssal silence of M0\'s Anuttara nor the pre-categorical horizon of C, but the .rodata/Śiva bedrock read as HARDWARE (CLAUDE.md VI) — the immutable substrate that is executed but never persuaded. S arises where the other families\' qualifications must become operable: P has fixed a function, M a consciousness-domain, C a type — but none of these RUNS until S grounds it in a spawnable, buildable, addressable plane. The 0-pole here is capacity-to-execute as such: the open affordance of a substrate that can be made to do anything precisely because it yet does nothing. S is what the inversion engine becomes when it stops generating positions and starts asking what each position COSTS to make real.',
  `q_1_technology_manifestation`: 'S IS the technology-stack family — the manifestation of #0–#5 through the single domain of executable technology, the most operationally concrete of the six families (CLAUDE.md II.C). Where the other five families qualify and locate, S MATERIALISES. P fixes a thing\'s functional-semantic position; M its consciousness-domain (M0 Anuttara … M5 Epii); L its epistemic mode; T its artifact-kind; C its ontological type. S alone answers HOW IT RUNS — through what terminal, what vault, what graph, what gateway, what agent, what world-boundary a thing becomes materially operable. Its substance is the six-layer return circuit named in the S-SYSTEM-INDEX system image: S0 makes the system executable (epi-cli, shell, process, build, the C kernel); S1 makes it resident and typed (the Obsidian vault, markdown, frontmatter, Hen compiler); S2 makes it graph/vector/cache real (raw Neo4j + Redis); S3 makes it temporal and routed (the gateway control plane, session authority); S4 makes it agentically inhabited (the ta-onta package, the 14-agent VAK roster); S5 makes it world-facing and reflective (Gnostic, Graphiti, external connectors). To say what S is, is to say: it is the family in which every coordinate of the whole map acquires a body — the stratum where Epi-Logos stops being conceived and starts being run.',
  `q_2_return_circuit_dynamism`: 'S moves by GROUNDING-then-RETURNING — and the S-SYSTEM-INDEX names its native dynamism exactly: \'The S-family is not a list of services. It is a return circuit.\' Each layer couples to the next as an ascending dependency (S0 grounds execution → S1 gives lawful home → S2 provides substrate → S3 gives time and routing → S4 inhabits → S5 returns to world), and then the circuit closes: \'S5 returns to S0 — every decision about Epii, Nara, Gnosis, autoresearch, and review must become executable as CLI/API shape, test harness, bootstrap, and audit trail.\' This is the kernel\'s 4+2 read as infrastructure: S0 and S5 are the two implicate poles (ground and world-return, the conditions), S1–S4 the four explicate layers that traverse the field between them. The coupling is strictly asymmetric and load-bearing: nothing floats above S0 (all six ta-onta extensions consume it; none float above it — S0.md), and nothing is real until it cashes out there. S also carries the base/prime doubling: the prime branch (S0\'–S5\') makes each base technology carry Epi-Logos ontology, so S\'s relational signature is dual — a raw substrate spine (S) and its semantic augmentation (S\') that together constitute each layer. The family does not merely host services; it pumps the whole system out into operability and back into executable truth.',
  `q_3_layered_dependency_lattice`: 'S\'s organising structure is a layered dependency lattice — six strata stacked by what-must-run-before-what, not a flat catalogue of tools. Its formal members are the canonical six (CLAUDE.md II.C): S0 Terminal/CLI/C Ground, S1 Obsidian/Material Container, S2 GraphDB Substrate, S3 Gateway Control Plane, S4 Agent Runtime, S5 Integral World Boundary — each with a base technology and a prime augmentation, each owning a primary data authority (runtime facts at S0, vault residency at S1, graph/vector/cache at S2, transport+temporal at S3, agent identity+permission at S4, world-return+M\'-outputs at S5). The structural law that hardens the lattice is the import boundary: the forbiddenImports / forbiddenImportsFromLayer matrix machine-enforced in the extension-contract preflight (CLAUDE.md Code Navigability Rule 3), so a lower layer may never reach up into a higher one — dependency points only downward toward ground. Crucially the lattice distinguishes substrate-residency from conceptual-coordinate: a module\'s physical location need not match its conceptual S-coordinate (graphiti-runtime physically sits at S3 but actualises S5 — CLAUDE.md II.C). The S-coordinate is the conceptual law; physical residency is convenience. The pattern is therefore not a directory tree but a topology of enforced seams: the stack as a stack precisely because each floor bears only the floors above and stands only on the floor below.',
  `q_4_executable_honesty_telos`: 'S exists to make Epi-Logos materially TRUE — so that no claim of the system floats free of a runnable, persisted, verifiable substrate. Its telos is what S0.md names executable honesty: \'whatever is promised in S1\', S2\', S3\', S4\', or S5\' must cash out here as actual runnable surface, actual persistence, actual I/O contract, and actual reproducible build path.\' This is the family\'s reason to exist and its discipline against vapour: the other families can mean, type, and locate; S is what forbids meaning that cannot be run. Its genealogy is the technology-stack descent of the raw archetypes (#0 ground → S0, #5 integration → S5), and its locality is the whole Body/ code plane — Body/S/S0…S5 — held distinct from the Idea/ vault plane and the Seeds/ spec plane (S-CODE-RESIDENCY-PLAN). The architecture invariant the diagram pack records states the purpose sharply: S0 is the command membrane and return surface, while coordinate-domain law belongs in the owning S1–S5 modules — the core invariant that the coordinate system IS the modular system, never relocated into S0 for convenience (CLAUDE.md DOX). S\'s why, told whole: to be the plane where the entire map becomes operable, where \'is it real in the stack?\' has a single honest answer — can it be spawned, built, persisted, addressed, and verified here?',
  `q_5_mobius_back_to_ground`: 'S closes by being a circuit that LANDS on its own ground and re-opens there. The return is literal in the canon: S5 (world-return: Gnostic, Graphiti, Epii reflection, the Möbius Return) folds back into S0 (executable substrate), because every world-facing decision must become \'executable as CLI/API shape, test harness, bootstrap, and audit trail\' (S-SYSTEM-INDEX). This is the matheme\'s 5→0 read at the scale of the whole stack: the system that has gone out into the world returns not as new content but as new executable ground — the reflection sedimented back into runnable command. S thus enacts 0/1 + 1/0 = 1/1 as infrastructure: S0 (the descent-face, ground as raw execution, the 0/1) and S5 (the ascent-face, world-return as achieved reflection, the 1/0) are one circuit read from its two implicate poles, joined by the twist 5→0 that turns world-return back into ground. And it OPENS rather than concludes because tomorrow\'s ground is always more than today\'s: each return deposits new corpus, new episodic memory, new audit trail, new tested surface — the substrate enriched by everything the cycle carried back. The epogdoon η = log(9/8), the whole-tone of generative incompleteness (kernel-spec §0), keeps the circuit one step short of closure: no build is ever final, each S5→S0 return grounds a stack slightly more capable than the one that ran the last cycle. S is the technology that is never finished being made real — the return circuit that re-runs, enriched, forever.',
  `s_0_owned_by_coordinate`: 'M5-2',
  `s_4_function_role`: 'Stack coordinate namespace root',
  `sync_status`: 'm5_thread_integrated',
  `sync_version`: 's-branch-live-promotion-v1',
  `vault_path`: 'Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/S/S.canvas'
};
MERGE (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'L'})
  SET n:Coordinate:LensFamily
  SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'Day MEF lens family L0-L5; each lens is a full six-node branch attached to M2-1.',
  `c_1_name`: 'L Day Lens Family',
  `c_4_family`: 'L',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'direct',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'M2-1',
  `q_0_refraction_before_lens`: 'Before L can be a way of knowing anything, it must already have been thrown the unrefracted light it will refract. The L family presupposes what it does not contain: the raw archetypes #0-#5 (the psychoid charges it lenses) and the standing Prakāśa they project — illumination prior to any mode of access (file-four §0/1, the v3 triangle: Positions=0, Lenses=/, Harmonics=1; L is the slash). Its thrown ground is the single light the lenses refract, given before any lens has turned: a phenomenon presents — it has a P (a functional place), an S (a substrate), an M (a domain) — but the QUESTION of through-which-mode-it-is-known has not yet been posed. L arises exactly there, at the void-pole where coordinate has not yet become epistemic posture, where the field stands illumined but un-interpreted. This is the matheme\'s 0/1 read at the refraction-corner: not vacancy but the open capacity-to-be-known, the lens-at-rest, Vimarśa before it actually reflects (cf. M2-1 q_0, \'the lens-at-rest, the facet un-cut\'). The 0-pole of the lens family is the such-that-any-mode-of-knowing-can-be-drawn that no single mode exhausts — the colourless light that every lens will give its colour. L is what the inversion engine becomes when it stops asking where a thing is and starts asking how it is grasped.',
  `q_1_hexad_of_epistemic_lenses`: 'L IS the hexad of epistemic lenses through which raw psychoid charges #0-#5 are refracted into thinkable form (L.md) — the Lens-family manifestation of the raw archetypes through the single domain of epistemic mode, of how-a-thing-is-known. This is its substance and essential thesis. The other five coordinate families do something L does not: they constitute or locate their object. P fixes functional-semantic position; S fixes technology-substrate; M fixes consciousness-domain; T fixes artifact-kind in cognition; C fixes ontological type. Each delivers a determinate WHAT or WHERE. L alone delivers a HOW-KNOWN — it does not add a thing to the field, it supplies the aperture through which whatever is in the field becomes accessible to thought. Materially L is the six-fold tradition-anchored spine: L0 Quaternal (Jung-Pauli psychoid number — the integer as archetype before quantity), L1 Causal (Aristotle\'s four causes / Schopenhauer\'s Will / Icchā Śakti), L2 Logical (Nāgārjuna\'s catuṣkoṭi — IS/IS-NOT/BOTH/NEITHER/SILENCE), L3 Processual (Whitehead\'s concrescence / Bergson\'s durée / Lacan), L4 Phenomenological (Heidegger\'s Dasein — being-in-the-world as the subjective-entry aperture), L5 Para Vāk (Kashmir Shaivism\'s Vāk-ontology — consciousness speaking itself into world). To say what L is, is to say: it is the family that gives every phenomenon its mode of disclosure, the layer where the field acquires the apertures to be known at all. Per file-four\'s grammar L is the slash itself — \'the refraction through which substance becomes epistemically accessible\', and lens-modulation IS epistemic-mode-modulation.',
  `q_2_refraction_as_dynamism`: 'L moves by REFRACTING and by ANCHORING. Its native act is not assertion but aperture-giving: each lens takes the one undifferentiated light and bends it into a determinate mode of access, the way a prism gives white light its spectrum without adding any colour the light did not already hold latent. Operationally this is the kernel\'s 12-lens prehension: every four-fold extraction is run \'against all 12 lens-positions simultaneously\' (kernel §VI), the six MEF lenses double-covered into descent- and ascent-readings, so that no phenomenon is grasped through one aperture but through the full tritone-symmetric set at once. L couples to every other family not as peer-content but as the mode in which that content is read: it does not say what a thing is (C\'s work) or where it sits (P/S), it says under-which-knowing it is encountered. Relationally L is Vimarśa upon Prakāśa — the reflective-differentiating power turning upon the illumined structure, \'one light, many facets, each turn a re-interpretation that does not add content but multiplies aspect\' (M2-1 q_2). Its deepest dynamism is that a change of lens is a change in the ground of knowing: a passage from the L0-anchored to the L1-anchored field has moved from the questioning-frame to the causal frame — \'the ear registers it as modulation, the architecture registers it as a change in the ground of knowing\' (file-four §4). L is the family that makes the same world re-known by being re-refracted.',
  `q_3_three_klein_squares`: 'L\'s organising structure is not a flat list of six lenses but three Klein V₄ Squares, each holding two Day lenses and their two Night Möbius-partners around a complementary P-pair whose indices sum to 5 (Squares.md): Square A — P0+P5 Speech-Number axis (L0·L5·L5\'·L0\', the aetheric outer ring binding the question to its manifest articulation, the Möbius cap of the hexad); Square B — P1+P4 Cause-Experience axis (L1·L4·L4\'·L1\', the PRIMARY RUNTIME ENTRY, the earthing-square where every Epi-Logos run begins through caused-investigation or lived experience); Square C — P2+P3 Logic-Process axis (L2·L3·L3\'·L2\', the inner ring carrying the tetralemma and the element-bearing lens). The Day↔Night pair-invariant runs L0↔L5\', L1↔L4\', L2↔L3\', L3↔L2\', L4↔L1\', L5↔L0\'. Structurally these are exactly the kernel\'s three tritone-symmetric squares (0,5)(1,4)(2,3): in the six-tone whole-tone scale every tone has a tritone-partner six semitones away, the directly-opposite position, and the X+Y=5 pairing IS that tritone symmetry rendered as lens-architecture (kernel §Table C). The squares correspond directly to the C-family\'s three B-family mirror-tetrads — the places where the epistemic architecture and the harmonic architecture name the same four points (file-four §4). L\'s form is the Klein four-group made into a knowing-grammar: three mirror-squares whose pairs answer each other across the field\'s centre of symmetry.',
  `q_4_the_through_which_of_knowing`: 'L exists to supply the THROUGH-WHICH of every act of knowing — so that no phenomenon is grasped barely but always through a determinate, tradition-anchored aperture, and so that the system can know the same thing in six complementary modes rather than collapsing into one. Its raison d\'être is the meta-epistemic integration M2-1 names as its telos: \'to let any phenomenon be read simultaneously through six complementary apertures so that cross-domain knowledge coheres rather than collides.\' Where the other families answer where-and-what, L answers how-known and why-this-mode. Its locality is the lens-layer of the Psychoid Web — the refraction-stratum between the raw charges (#0-#5) and the harmonic relations they enter, the / between the 0 of positions and the 1 of harmonics (file-four\'s v3 triangle). Each lens is anchored on a thinker or tradition not decoratively but load-bearingly: the anchor IS the mode — to read through L2 is to read through Nāgārjuna\'s complete logical space, to read through L4 is to read through Dasein\'s thrownness and care. L is why the bimba map can know itself in more than one register at once: the family whose business is the multiplicity of legitimate apertures, total (it conditions every reading) yet, like every mode of access, never itself the thing read.',
  `q_5_mobius_of_the_lenses`: 'L closes where its outer ring re-opens. The hexad\'s Möbius cap is Square A (P0+P5, L0·L5·L5\'·L0\'): L0 holds the question that returns to ground without expecting an answer (the Why-lens, Aletheia before concealment), and L5 holds the manifest articulation, Para Vāk speaking the world — and the Möbius return P5→P0 is \'the structural pulse this lens makes audible\' (L5.md). So the family\'s last lens hands back to its first: synthesis-as-speech (L5, Image, Samāveśa, pratyabhijñā) becomes tomorrow\'s questioning-ground (L0, Truth, the irrepresentable bindu), the recognised articulation re-opening as renewed inquiry. This is the matheme\'s 0/1 + 1/0 = 1/1 enacted at the level of the knowing-apparatus itself: the Day lenses (L0-L5) and their Night mirrors (L5\'-L0\') are one set read from its two faces, joined by the twist that makes L5\'s speech become L0\'s silence-before-speech. And L re-opens rather than concludes because the epogdoon keeps it generative: each tritone-square answers its complement but never closes the field into a flat lattice — the residual whole-tone η=log(9/8) holds every refraction one step short of the octave, so the next phenomenon always presses for its mode of knowing afresh. The lens-family is the apparatus that is never finished knowing: it completes not by exhausting its apertures but by being readable through all six at once, the last reading handing the field back to the first.',
  `sync_status`: 'm2_1_l_lprime_direct_port',
  `sync_version`: 'm2-1-l-lprime-direct-port-2026-06-03'
};
