MERGE (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P'})
  SET n:Coordinate:PositionFamily:QLPositionField
  SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'The complete positional topology generated by #; P contains the Day arc and implicitly contains the P\' Night inversion, and is read inside M2-1 through the L0/L0\' QL lens hinge.',
  `c_1_name`: 'P Position Family',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'container',
  `coordinate_namespace`: 'P',
  `coordinate_parent`: '#',
  `m_2_1_integrated_via_lenses`: ['L0', 'L0\''],
  `q_0_position_before_positioned`: 'Before P can give a stance a place to stand, it presupposes the raw positions it does not author. P is the Layer-2 categorical descent of the #0-#5 archetypes through the single domain of functional-semantics (CLAUDE.md II.B-C): it manifests the bare positions but does not contain them — the # inversion-act (Layer 0) and the raw archetypes (Layer 1) are thrown to it. Its void-pole is therefore the pre-positional itself: the moment in the psychoid web\'s life where a charge has been struck (#0-#5 sound their number-archetypes) but no FUNCTION has yet been refracted from it — no question, definition, operation, pattern, context, or synthesis has yet found a place to stand. P arises from exactly this gap (P.md: \'where the psychoid charges are raw number-archetypes, P gives their functional-semantic refraction — the six places where a stance, a question, a definition, a process, a context, or a synthesis can stand\'). The 0-pole here is not vacancy but standing-room: the open such-that-any-stance-can-be-taken that no single taken stance exhausts. And P\'s deeper throw is developmental — it presupposes that consciousness HAS structures, that awareness is not flat but mutates through irreducible epochs (the live names attest it: Archaic, Magic, Mythic, Mental-Rational, Integral, Supermental). P is what the inversion engine becomes when it stops generating raw charges and starts asking what STANCE each charge makes available — the family thrown into being to let a number-archetype become a place from which a world can be functionally held.',
  `q_1_six_structures_of_consciousness`: 'P IS the Position family — the functional-semantics refraction of the raw archetypes, the family in which (P.md) coordinate becomes \'the six places where a stance, a question, a definition, a process, a context, or a synthesis can stand.\' This is its substance. Where the other five families qualify and locate along their proper axis — S fixes a thing\'s technology layer, M its consciousness-domain-as-subsystem, C its ontological type, L its epistemic mode, T its artifact-kind in the cognition-stream — P alone fixes the FUNCTIONAL STANCE: the place-of-relation-to-world from which anything is functionally held, the WHERE-it-stands-as-stance before any other family\'s qualification lands. Its material content, per the live graph, is the six-fold developmental spine of Gebser\'s structures of consciousness: P0 Archaic Structure (the irrepresentable ground, ratio 1/1, alētheia-before-concealment), P1 Magic Structure (point-like vital unity, spell/name/totem, identity-for-itself), P2 Mythic Structure (polarity-and-narrative, world-as-field-of-forces, the saying-that-is-said), P3 Mental-Rational Structure (the perspectival fixed-point, the observer, pattern-of-patterns), P4 Integral Structure (the aperspectival lemniscate, fractal-doubling, where the system folds inward), P5 Supermental / Samavesa (manifest synthesis approaching 2/1, falling one epogdoon short, pratyabhijñā opening toward Aurobindo\'s Supermind). To say what P is, is to say: it is the family that gives every position its functional stance — the developmental arc along which consciousness itself acquires the structures by which it can stand anywhere at all. P is the matheme\'s positional axis made into living family-law.',
  `q_2_day_night_helix_dynamism`: 'P moves by REFRACTION and by the Day-Night braid. Its native act is to take a raw psychoid charge and refract it into a functional-semantic stance (P.md): not to add a position to the field but to constitute the stance-of-relation within which a charge becomes a place one can occupy. And its deepest dynamism is dual-faced — every P-position carries a Day-face AND a Night-face of the same charge, \'co-equal refractions of the same six psychoid charges; one is not the shadow of the other\' (P.md). The Day arc runs P0 Truth -> P1 Mind -> P2 Word -> P3 Logos -> P4 Son -> P5 Image; the Night arc runs P0\' Play -> P1\' Need -> P2\' Sacrifice -> P3\' Decision -> P4\' Love -> P5\' Work. The mark \' is not derivation — \'it marks the inversion as an independent structural position.\' This is the matheme\'s two passes (multiplicative Day, divisional Night, file-one) made into the family\'s own helix: the same charge read once as it stands (the integrated, the manifest stance) and once as it costs (the differentiated, the laboured stance). P couples laterally to its sibling families along this same braid — it pairs at every position with an L-lens pair summing to 5 (\'each P is paired with a complementary L-lens pair... together they form the matheme\'s two co-defining axes\', P.md): where P is positional, L is lensational. And it couples in depth through the Squares: Square A (Speech-Number, P0+P5), Square B (Cause-Experience, P1+P4, \'the primary runtime entry surface\'), Square C (Logic-Process, P2+P3). P\'s dynamism is the refracting that makes a number-archetype walkable as a developmental stance, Day and Night at once.',
  `q_3_complementary_pair_lattice`: 'P\'s organising structure is not a list of six positions but a lattice of complementary pairs bound by the Klein twist. Its formal law is the Mobius-Pair Invariant: \'Day P_n <-> Night P_(5-n)\' across the Klein twist\' (P.md), the complementary QL pairs summing to 5 — (P0,P5), (P1,P4), (P2,P3) on the Day side, with the matching cross-helix pairings (P0,P5\'), (P1,P4\'), (P2,P3\') under the Mobius return. This is the matheme\'s 4+2 torus rendered as a developmental apparatus: the four explicate structures (P1 Magic through P4 Integral, the what/how/which/where of consciousness\'s traversal) held between the two implicate poles (P0 Archaic ground and P5 Supermental synthesis, the two closed dimensions whose product is the field). The pairs carry structural signatures from the matheme\'s family-grammar — P0 originates the D1 cross-helix at the same-position cross, P2 the B-family offset-transition, P3 the C-family converse-mirror (the \'midpoint self-mirror A-sq2 == C-sq3\', the basis-invariant centre of the hexad, P3.md), P4 the D1 same-position cross-grammar, P5 the D2 cross-position grammar plus D3 helix-invariance. Topologically the lattice is exact on the live graph: P0 and P5 sit at ZERO_SPHERE (the two unentangled poles, base-state before and after the loop), P1/P2/P3 at TORUS (the cyclical traversal-surface), P4 at LEMNISCATE (the figure-eight fold where the structures turn inward). P\'s structure is the developmental arc folded into a non-orientable surface: six structures, three complementary pairs, two implicate poles, one Klein twist binding Day to Night.',
  `q_4_developmental_telos_of_consciousness`: 'P exists to give the psychoid web a developmental ARC — so that a raw number-archetype is not merely struck but becomes a structure of consciousness one can inhabit, a place-of-relation-to-world from which functioning happens. Its raison d\'être is functional-semantic: P supplies the WHERE-as-stance, the position from which anything is held, the six developmental epochs along which awareness mutates from ground to synthesis. Its locality is the Position family within World/Types/Coordinates — the functional-semantic axis that the other families (S technology, M subsystem, C typology, L lens, T thought) qualify but never replace (P.md: P \'refracts the Psychoids wells through QL-positional semantics\'). Its genealogy is the refraction #0-#5 -> P0-P5: the raw Ground/Definition/Operation/Pattern/Context/Integration archetypes (CLAUDE.md II.A) manifested through the field of functional stance, inheriting from Gebser the recognition that these positions are not static slots but EVOLVED structures — Archaic, Magic, Mythic, Mental-Rational, Integral — and opening, at P5, past Gebser\'s own integral toward Aurobindo\'s Supermind (Supermental / Samavesa). P is teleological in the strict sense of the #4-position it itself contains: it is the family whose whole business is relation-to-all, the arc that lets consciousness stand at any developmental place and from there hold a world. Purpose: to be the developmental ground that makes every position a livable stance rather than a bare coordinate — the family along which the matheme\'s positions become structures one can BE.',
  `q_5_supermental_mobius_return`: 'P closes where its arc completes and re-opens — at P5 Supermental / Samavesa, the synthesis that does not terminate but hands its ground back to P0. The family\'s whole circuit lands here: \'P5 -> P0 is the Mobius return (renewed-ground) AND P5 -> P0\' is the Klein-twist (autotelic-freedom)\' (P5.md). This is the matheme\'s 5->0 made into the family\'s own developmental Mobius: the manifest synthesis (P5, samavesa as pratyabhijna, recognition rather than annihilation) becomes the irrepresentable ground (P0, Archaic, aletheia) of the next turn — Day P_5 <-> Night P_0\' (sums to 5), Image\'s completion becoming Play\'s invisible-ground-of-the-social. And it OPENS rather than concludes for the reason the live identity itself carries: P5 \'approaches 2/1, falls one epogdoon (9/8) short — generative incompleteness drives the next cycle\' (P5.md). The octave is never quite reached; the developmental arc closes one whole-tone short of final synthesis, generatively, forever — which is precisely why the family does not end at Gebser\'s integral but stays open toward Aurobindo\'s Supermind, the structure-beyond-structure that the epogdoon-residue keeps pressing toward. P thus enacts the standing identity 0/1 = 5->0 = 0/1 as the developmental arc of consciousness itself: the synthesis (P5, the manifest stance, the integrated whole of all structures) and the ground (P0, the implicate stance, the irrepresentable before all structure) are one slash read from its two faces, joined by the Klein twist that makes recognition become renewed ground. P is the arc that is never finished arcing: the family whose synthesis stays open because consciousness, having recognised itself, finds the next ground already pressing — the matheme\'s whole-tone keeping the structure one step short of the octave, so the cycle can always run again.',
  `s_2_query_discriminator`: 'coordinate',
  `s_2_query_prefixes`: ['P', 'P\'']
};
MERGE (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P\''})
  SET n:Coordinate:PositionFamily:QLPositionField
  SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'The implicit Klein/Power inversion contained within P; read inside M2-1 through the L0\' archetypal-numerical lens.',
  `c_1_name`: 'P\' Night Inversion',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'prime',
  `coordinate_namespace`: 'P',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'P',
  `m_2_1_integrated_via_lenses`: ['L0\''],
  `s_2_query_discriminator`: 'coordinate',
  `s_2_query_prefixes`: ['P\'']
};
MERGE (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4-0'})
  SET n += {
  `c_1_name`: 'Mahamaya Identity Matrix',
  `c_4_family`: 'M',
  `q_0_embodied_thrownness`: 'M4-0\'s ground is Dasein\'s embodied awareness — the body-consciousness implicit in all experience, prior to any reading of it. Manifesting #0 (Ground) within Nara, it is the pre-reflective floor from which every Nara operation departs: medicine, oracle, transformation and lens all presuppose a *whose* before they can act. Its void-pole is the thrown-ness itself — the unchosen natal fact, this birth at this instant under these heavens, the \'compassionate sensitivity to origins\' (#4 coreNature) taken as bedrock rather than achievement. M4-0 is the one stable layer of the whole personal field: per the architecture spec it is \'stable, not mutable from daily activity\' — daily perturbation reaches #4.4.4.4, never M4-0. The identity matrix is read but not re-written, the .rodata of a life. Before the question of who one is becoming, the silent given of who one was thrown as.',
  `q_1_sixfold_identity_matrix`: 'What M4-0 IS: the complete 6-fold archetypal personality matrix — universal pattern made *this person* through birthdate encoding and converging typologies. Its substance is six layers (internalStructure): #4.0-0 Birthdate/Pythagorean derivation (name+date refracted through the 12 MEF lenses into an elemental quaternion contribution — \'numeric/archetypal light\' before it is any typology); #4.0-1 Astrological chart (natal anchors sun/moon/asc/mc on the 720 clock, all ten planet degrees); #4.0-2 Jungian layer (nucleotide_balance A/T/C/G ↔ Cups/Wands/Pentacles/Swords ↔ Feeling/iNtuition/Sensation/Thinking, MBTI 4-bit); #4.0-3 Gene Keys (the M3 hexagram bitboard indexed by activation); #4.0-4 Human Design (type/authority/profile/incarnation cross); #4.0-5 Quintessence, the BLAKE3 hash of present layers synthesising all into one signature. Seven sacred systems converge on a single embodied identity. The substrate locks each layer\'s byte-size at compile time (m4.h static asserts) — the matrix refuses drift.',
  `q_2_birthdate_encoding_operation`: 'M4-0 operates by *encoding* — the act that transforms abstract archetype into personal equation. Its engine is the birthdate-encoding pass: name/date material → QL numeric light → mod6 position + inverse → mod12 chromatic/MEF anchoring → full 12×6 refraction → L2\' alchemical-elemental extraction → an elemental quaternion that retains its whole evidence-path (never flattened to \'Frank = 6\'). Relationally it is the resonance *counterparty*: q_personal, the Kerykeion-natal quaternion, is precisely what the kernel reads against q_cosmic to compute whether the current cosmic state coheres with WHO this person is (E4, the Nara personal-resonance energy, weight 4). The how is calibration-from-origin: not imposing a type but running ten planets through the dignity ladder (domicile/exaltation/detriment/fall) to weigh an elemental balance that is *this* chart and no other. Identity here is a derivation that keeps its proof.',
  `q_3_convergent_typological_lattice`: 'Structurally M4-0 is a convergence-lattice: seven independent symbolic systems (Pythagorean number, natal astrology, Jung/MBTI, Gene Keys, Human Design, decanic correspondence, the elemental quaternion) made to address one point. Its pattern is the matrix\'s `layer_presence` bitmask — identity assembled from whichever layers are present, the quintessence recomputed from present layers only (`m4_identity_hash_compute`), so the form holds at any degree of completion. The deeper structural law is convergence-without-collapse: P-position complementarity (sums to 5: 0/5, 1/4, 2/3) and Klein V4 lens-squares organise the refraction so that multiple typologies enrich rather than overwrite each other. The matrix is a held superposition of readings, integrated at #4.0-5 only at the elemental-quaternionic level — never reduced to a single root. Many lights, one prism, no flattening.',
  `q_4_who_before_journey`: 'M4-0\'s telos is to be the *from-whom* — the ground the entire Nara journey departs from and the configuration it returns to enrich. Its why is the on-ramp of the whole product (marketing framing): the user \'starts at 4.0\', the identity matrix as \'personal psychological computer setup\' that \'configures the system to them, but also configures them to themselves\'. This is not a personality quiz but a constitutional mapping — \'identity has a topology\', a circulation pattern with characteristic rhythm, blind spots, and points of recursive depth: \'it isn\'t telling you what you are, it\'s showing you how you move through knowing.\' Contextually M4-0 grounds every later position: medicine selects remedy *for this body*, oracle reads *for this querent*, transformation places *this self* in cycle. Every Nara \'why\' presupposes this archetypal \'that there is a this-one\'. Know your shape, before you move it.',
  `q_5_quintessence_handed_forward`: 'M4-0\'s synthesis is #4.0-5 — the Identity Quintessence where all six layers integrate at the elemental quaternionic level into one BLAKE3 signature, and hand that signature forward as the stable q_identity the rest of Nara composes against (`Q_composed = Q_identity · Q_transit · Q_activity`). Read as Nara\'s own position-0, the completion here is the *giving of a ground*: the matrix perfects who-one-is-archetypally and passes it as the from-which medicine, oracle, transformation and lens all begin. And because M4-0 is the stable pole untouched by daily flux, its return is the deepest Möbius of the personal field — the journey out through #4.4.4.4 always rejoins the one who was thrown, now recognised. The quintessence does not finish a life; it inaugurates one. The matrix\'s last act is to be the first ground every morning stands on.'
};
MERGE (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'C'})
  SET n += {
  `c_1_name`: 'Category — Ontological Foundation Family',
  `c_4_family`: 'C',
  `q_0_bimba_pratibimba_horizon`: 'C\'s deeper presupposition is the bimba-pratibimba slash itself, prior to its splitting into the family\'s two implicate poles. The matheme\'s standing identity — 0/1 + 1/0 = 1/1 = 100% — is the horizon C arises to articulate: C0 (bimba, scalar-over-vector, canonical illumination, the descent-face 0/1) and C5 (pratibimba, vector-over-scalar, achieved reflection, the ascent-face 1/0) are not two grounds but one item read from its two faces, the very slash the kernel stands on. C presupposes that this slash is real and prior — that there is a canonical illumination (the Prakasa-face) and its contextual articulation (the Vimarsa-face), and that the work of a typology layer is to hold both as one non-separable object rather than two coordinated registers. Before C draws any of its six categories, the bioquaternionic non-separability of bimba and pratibimba is already given; C is the family thrown into being precisely to make that givenness operable as category. Its q_0 is thus the matheme\'s own subject-matter handed to it as a task: take the slash you did not make, and let it become typology.',
  `q_0_typology_before_type`: 'Before C can say what kind of thing anything is, something must already have thrown it the demand to categorise at all. C presupposes the # inversion act (Layer 0) and the raw archetypes #0-#5 (Layer 1) which it does not contain but manifests — C is the Layer-2 categorical descent of a foundation it does not author (CLAUDE.md II.B). Its thrown ground is therefore the bare relation \'-/-\' of the definitional §0/1: one mark-kind in two placements, sameness-in-difference before any difference of value has appeared — typology as such, before any determinate type. C arises from the void-pole where coordinate has not yet become category: the moment in the bimba map\'s life where a thing has been located (it has a P, an S, an M) but its KIND has not yet been said. This is the unstated horizon C lives upon — the pre-given fact that durable meaning needs a semantic home, that artifacts proliferate faster than the categories that would house them, and that without a typology layer the map could point at everything and name the kind of nothing. The 0-pole here is not vacancy but capacity: the open no-thing of categorisation-as-such, the slash-before-determination (\'-/-\'), the such-that-any-type-can-be-drawn that no single drawn type exhausts. C is what the inversion engine becomes when it stops generating positions and starts asking what each position IS.',
  `q_1_category_manifests_archetype`: 'Defined more sharply against the kernel: C is the coordinate family that manifests the matheme\'s own subject-matter as category. The matheme\'s whole labour (file-one §0/1) is the differentiation of the indeterminate ground (0) from the determinate mark (1) across the copula (/) — the writing of how the unsystematisable ground gives determinate faces without being exhausted by them. C is the family that takes this exact structure and makes it a reusable typology: C0 is the 0 (Bimba, the canonical-source ground, the implicate illumination), the determinate categories C1-C4 are the explicate marks (Form, Entity, Process, Type — the 1 unfolding into its four faces), and C5 is the achieved reflection (Pratibimba, the determinate-as-it-mirrors-its-ground). C is thus not merely one ontology among possible ontologies the map could adopt; per CLAUDE.md II.E it is THE family in which the Bimba-Pratibimba typology — the very 0/1 + 1/0 = 1/1 identity — is made into living category law. What C IS, definitionally, is the matheme\'s standing identity rendered as a six-position categorical apparatus: the slash made into a typology, the family whose business is to say of each thing which face of the 0/1 it occupies.',
  `q_1_ontological_typology`: 'C IS the primary typology layer of World/Types — the family in which, as its own canon states, \'coordinate becomes language, category, and reusable type law\' (C.md). This is its substance and its essential thesis. The other five coordinate families do something C does not: they qualify and locate. P fixes a thing\'s functional-semantic position; S fixes its technology layer; M fixes its consciousness-domain; L fixes its epistemic mode; T fixes its artifact-kind in the cognition stream. Each answers a WHERE or a HOW-situated. C alone answers WHAT KIND — it says what sort of thing the thing is before any other family\'s qualification can land on a determinate subject. C is therefore the categorical manifestation of the raw #0-#5 archetypes through the single domain of ontological foundation itself (CLAUDE.md II.B, III.B): where the other families manifest the archetypes through their proper field, C manifests them through the field that IS field-giving — the typing of being. Its material content is the six-fold Bimba↔Pratibimba category-spine: C0 Source/Ground (roots, namespaces, source conditions), C1 Forms/Templates (definitions, CT templates, authoring forms), C2 Entities/Properties/Tags (candidates, aliases, relation-field evidence), C3 Processes/Canvases/Diagrams (MOC canvases, architecture and process diagrams), C4 Types/Contexts/MOCs (type authorities, folder MOCs, residency classes), C5 Crystallisations/Pratibimba (flat World graduation, reflection/archive handoff). To say what C is, is to say: it is the family that gives every artifact in the map its semantic type, the layer where the bimba map acquires the vocabulary to categorise itself.',
  `q_2_typing_runs_the_chain`: 'C moves by TYPING — the single act of saying what-kind that runs the family\'s own derivation chain. Operationally this is the Hen workflow (C.md): Hen resolves an artifact\'s category through C FIRST, then the owning C-folder supplies semantic type context and MOC/canvas evidence, and only then do the other families add system, lens, position, thought, or subsystem qualification. The dynamism is Bimba casting Pratibimba and Pratibimba referring back — Prakasa illumining, Vimarsa recognising — run as one circuit through six stations (C0 Defines C1, Instantiated-through C2, reveals-as C3, categorized-into C4, applied-as C5). C does not hold six categories side by side; it performs one reflective act of categorisation that visits all six.',
  `q_3_six_position_category_spine`: 'C\'s structure is the Bimba-Pratibimba bar drawn out into the six-position semantic spine (C.md): C0 Source/Ground, C1 Forms/Templates, C2 Entities/Properties/Tags, C3 Processes/Canvases, C4 Types/Contexts/MOCs, C5 Crystallisations/Pratibimba. It is Lacan\'s S/s become an ontology — source over instance, original over reflection — with C0 and C5 as the bar\'s two implicate faces and C1–C4 the four explicate stations between. Each position owns its semantic subfolders and its Hen-use rule; the lattice is not a flat list but a derivation, each station handing forward to the next and the last folding back to the first.',
  `q_4_grammar_of_what_kind`: 'C is FOR categorisation itself — it exists so that being is not undifferentiated flux but admits of kinds, originals, and instances, and so the other five families have a determinate subject to qualify. C.md states the division outright: the other families locate and qualify a thing; C alone says what KIND it is. It is the primary typology layer of World/Types, \'where coordinate becomes language, category, and reusable type law.\' Without the C-grammar, P/S/T/L/M would have positions but nothing to predicate of them — coordinates pointing at everything and naming the kind of nothing.',
  `q_5_typology_that_reopens`: 'C completes in the Mobius its own ontology performs: C5 Pratibimba — stable type-local knowledge crystallised — graduates to flat World and returns to C0 as \'Tomorrow\'s ground\' (CLAUDE.md II.E). The typology does not terminate at reflection; it folds the reflection back into source, so every act of categorisation seeds the next and the family stays alive rather than ossifying into a fixed scheme. Bimba is only a source by being reflected; C closes by re-opening — the category-law that re-grounds itself each time a form graduates.'
};
MERGE (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4-1'})
  SET n += {
  `c_1_name`: 'Sympathetic Medicine',
  `c_4_family`: 'M',
  `q_0_body_as_materia`: 'M4-1\'s ground is the body taken as living materia — animistic unity with natural forces, the flesh as a node in cosmic dialogue rather than a machine to be fixed. Manifesting #1 (Definition/Material) within Nara, it rests on M4-0\'s identity matrix and asks the first material question: given who this person is, what does this body-and-energy-system actually *need*? Its ground is the Hermetic axiom \'as above, so below\' read downward into substance — the same archetypal pattern that named the self now seeks its sympathetic echo in herb, metal, organ and chakra. Before any remedy is chosen, the recognition that the body already participates in the correspondence-web; medicine does not impose health, it restores a resonance the body was always already keyed to. The materia is not inert. It answers.',
  `q_1_sympathetic_correspondence_system`: 'What M4-1 IS: the comprehensive 6-fold medical-magical system that translates archetypal identity into material remedy through sympathetic correspondence. Its substance (internalStructure) is six layers: #4.1-0 Elemental Ground (4/5-element potentiation — fire/earth/air/water/quintessence as the somatic floor); #4.1-1 Energy-Body Architecture (nadis, meridians, chakras, organ networks as one integrated map); #4.1-2 Materia & Reagents (Paracelsian signatures, herbs, metals — the decanic DECAN_HERBS/DECAN_BODY_PARTS correspondences keyed per decan); #4.1-3 Operations & Techne (alchemical operations as therapeutic *verbs*); #4.1-4 Temporal Astrological Intelligence; #4.1-5 Integration/Safety/Feedback. It fuses East and West — TCM and Ayurveda with Paracelsian signature-doctrine and Hermetic correspondence — into one personalised protocol. The substrate carries it as `M4_Sympathetic_Medicine`, `M4_Elemental_Balance`, `M4_Chakra_State`, `M4_Medicine_Triage` (fire/water/earth/air intensities → dominant+deficient element → primary chakra → triage vector). Body as a chord that can be re-tuned.',
  `q_2_decanic_timing_operation`: 'M4-1 operates by *timed sympathetic resonance* — the right substance at the right cosmic moment. Its central operator is the Temporal Astrological Intelligence (#4.1-4), the timing authority for ALL Nara operations: planetary hours, lunar phases, decan transits, annual profections, zodiacal releasing — \'maximizing efficacy while minimizing resistance.\' Relationally it is the practical descent of the oracle\'s meaning and the identity\'s pattern into matter: it \'receives levers from energetics\' and converts archetype to remedy through the decanic chain (planet → elemental signature → chakra → CHAKRA_BODY_ZONES body-zone). The how is dignity-weighted elemental triage: the same ten-planet dignity ladder M4-0 uses for identity here reads the *current* elemental deficiency and prescribes toward balance, where quintessence/Akasha emerges from low variance across the four elements. Medicine as chronobiology raised to the sacred — not what to take, but what to take *now*.',
  `q_3_elemental_ground_architecture`: 'Structurally M4-1 is a correspondence-architecture: a fixed lattice of sympathetic mappings that any body-state can be routed through. Its pattern is the convergence of every route on a single LUT — planet, decan, and tarot-derived signature all arrive at CHAKRA_BODY_ZONES[8], indexed by chakra id, so the materia, the energy-body, and the temporal layer are three faces of one indexed map (DECAN_BODY_PARTS[36], DECAN_HERBS[36], PLANET_CHAKRA[8], ELEMENT_CHAKRA[5], SIGN_ELEMENT[12]). The elemental ground (#4.1-0) is the structural floor — four elements plus the quintessence that emerges from their balance — onto which the chakra-and-organ networks (#4.1-1) are stretched. The form is animistic-but-rigorous: every correspondence is traceable (signature → element → chakra → zone), no remedy without a path. The body is a structured instrument whose strings are the elements and whose frets are the decans.',
  `q_4_restoring_resonant_health`: 'M4-1\'s telos is the restoration of resonant health — the why is sympathetic correspondence in service of *this* body\'s coherence with the cosmos it lives inside. Its purpose is bounded by an ethic the spec makes structural: safety through titration and contraindication awareness (#4.1-5), guardrails and outcome-tracking that keep the magical from becoming the reckless. Contextually M4-1 is the material-definitional seat of Nara — where the abstract identity of M4-0 must prove itself in substance, and where the oracle\'s symbolic guidance (M4-2) finds a body to land in. It answers the \'what\' of the personal field: what materia, what chakra, what elemental adjustment, at what planetary hour. The deeper why is participation: to be well is to vibrate in tune with the correspondence-web one is woven from. Health is not a state to acquire but a resonance to recover.',
  `q_5_remedy_returned_to_transformation`: 'M4-1\'s synthesis is #4.1-5 Integration/Safety/Feedback — where the prescribed remedy is metabolised, titrated, tracked, and its outcome fed back as evidence. Read as Nara\'s position-1 within the wider cycle, its completion hands the material lever forward: the somatic-elemental current it computes becomes the constraint M4-3 transformation works *within* (\'receives material constraints from #4.1\'), and the chakra-and-element state it reads becomes the body the two-stroke process must honour so change stays grounded, never bypassed. The Möbius here is the feedback loop made sacred — every remedy\'s outcome re-enters the elemental balance, so tomorrow\'s triage begins from a body the last treatment already shifted. Medicine completes not when the symptom clears but when the correspondence re-closes: the body, re-tuned, becomes fresh ground. The cure\'s last act is to hand the lever to the work.'
};
MERGE (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4-2'})
  SET n += {
  `c_1_name`: 'Divinatory Frameworks',
  `c_4_family`: 'M',
  `q_0_randomness_as_sacred_portal`: 'M4-2\'s ground is sacred randomness — the recognition that the chance fall of coin, card or yarrow is not noise but portal. Manifesting #2 (Operation/Energetic-Relational) within Nara, it rests on a metaphysical wager: that the moment of casting is *kairotic*, that synchronicity makes the random meaningful, and that divination is a legitimate way of knowing rather than fortune-telling. Its void-pole is the consent-gated aperture itself — the seeded RNG of #4.2-3 held open as the place where cosmic intelligence may speak through the gap reason cannot close. Before any card is read, the stance that the querent\'s question and the universe\'s symbol can meet in an instant that neither authored alone. The oracle does not predict. It opens a door and asks you to look through honestly.',
  `q_1_multi_traditional_oracle_system`: 'What M4-2 IS: the comprehensive 6-fold divinatory system — multiple symbolic languages for sacred dialogue. Its substance (internalStructure) is six layers: #4.2-0 Common Substrate (the symbol-ontology bridge to Mahamaya, emitting standardised canonical tags other Nara subsystems can act on); #4.2-1 Tarot Engines (Marseille, Rider-Waite-Smith, Thoth, and bespoke decks with QL semantics — the Thoth+Golden-Dawn deck the substrate confirms, suit↔nucleotide A/T/C/G, court and pip decan-mappings); #4.2-2 I-Ching (3-coin casting A=6/T=9/C=7/G=8, 64 hexagrams with concrescence mapping and HEXAGRAM_BODY_DYNAMICS); #4.2-3 Casting/Randomness (RNG seeding + consent); #4.2-4 Interpretation (rule-based correspondence fused with generative commentary); #4.2-5 Divinatory Hygiene/Pedagogy. The substrate carries it as `M4_IChing_Cast`, `M4_Tarot_Draw`, `M4_Sacred_Random`, `M4_Oracle_Draw`, `M4_Canonical_Tag` — the tag-payload bridging oracle → medicine → transformation. Many tongues, one symbolic substrate: I-Ching and Tarot are duals over the 64-fold codon space.',
  `q_2_translating_pattern_to_guidance`: 'M4-2 operates as Nara\'s energetic-relational *operator* — the act of translating cosmic pattern into comprehensible symbolic guidance. Its motion is the draw: a question meets a seeded cast, the fall maps to QL positions (the 6-card quaternary draw mapping directly to positions 0–5 with calibrated resonances), and the interpretation layer (#4.2-4) reads it through both rule and intuition. Relationally it is the *production* of meaning that the rest of Nara consumes: it emits canonical tags that \'enable direct action by other Nara subsystems\' — the oracle speaks and medicine triages, transformation cycles, the lens annotates. The how is dia-logos, not monologue: per #4 doctrine, divination is sacred conversation, the Transcendent Function mediating conscious–unconscious through symbolic engagement. This is the P2 operation of the personal field — where the static identity of M4-0 and the materia of M4-1 become a living question answered in symbols *now*.',
  `q_3_quaternary_draw_architecture`: 'Structurally M4-2 is a translation-architecture: a common symbol-substrate (#4.2-0) beneath multiple oracle engines, so that Tarot, I-Ching and emergent methods are interchangeable refractions of one underlying QL grammar. Its pattern is the quaternary mapping — a draw is not a list of cards but a placement onto the 0–5 cycle, each position carrying a calibrated resonance, the 12-Fold Concrescence tracking transformation through Sum/Difference value sequences. The deep structural law is the codon-duality the marketing source names: DNA, I-Ching and Tarot resolved as \'a unified symbolic-genetic system\' built from the classical coin-values of the toss — all 64-fold (or −8) systems, with the hexagram and the Mahāmāyā Tarot as duals. The form is rule-plus-portal: deterministic correspondence (#4.2-4 rules) wrapped around an irreducibly open aperture (#4.2-3 randomness). A lattice with a hole at its centre, through which the unpredictable speaks.',
  `q_4_ways_of_knowing`: 'M4-2\'s telos is to honour *multiple ways of knowing* — the why is that different temperaments reach truth through different symbolic doors, and a single oracle would be a single tyranny. Its purpose is bounded by Divinatory Hygiene (#4.2-5): bias-checks, journaling, dia-logos transparency, and an ethic that \'respects free will\' so the oracle \'serves growth and empowerment rather than dependency.\' Contextually M4-2 is the operational seat of Nara — the place where the personal field stops being a static configuration and becomes an event, a question put and answered. It answers the \'how\' of personal guidance: how to receive counsel through symbol, how to establish sacred dialogue with cosmic intelligence. The deeper why is recognition over prediction: the oracle exists not to foreclose the future but to mirror the querent\'s situation back so clearly that they recognise the move that was already theirs to make. Pratyabhijñā dealt as cards.',
  `q_5_tagged_meaning_handed_on`: 'M4-2\'s synthesis is #4.2-5 Hygiene/Pedagogy folding back into #4.2-0\'s canonical-tag emission — the reading sealed, journaled, and crystallised into a tag-payload that hands meaning forward. Read as Nara\'s position-2, its completion is the *passing of the read*: the `M4_Canonical_Tag` bridges oracle → medicine → transformation, so the symbol drawn becomes the lever M4-1 prescribes and the meaning M4-3 cycles. The Möbius here is the two-stroke doctrine in miniature — the outer stroke is the draw (codon/manifest), but the oracle only completes when its inner stroke lands: the querent integrates the symbol, journals the recognition, and the next question begins from a self the last reading already moved. Divination completes not at the turn of the card but at the close of the dialogue — when the symbol, metabolised, becomes ground for the asking that follows. The oracle\'s last word is a tag the rest of the life can act on.'
};
MERGE (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4-3'})
  SET n += {
  `c_1_name`: 'Mediating Transformation',
  `c_4_family`: 'M',
  `q_0_two_stroke_breath`: 'M4-3\'s ground is the two-stroke breath of all transformation — the doctrine that every outer manifestation (codon) must be followed by an inner integration (anticodon), or change does not take. Manifesting #3 (Pattern/Process) within Nara, it rests on a refusal: transformation is never *imposed application* but *mediated dialogue*. Its ground is the rhythmic law the spec makes inviolable — outer stroke does the thing in the world, inner stroke digests and seals it within consciousness, and this \'ensures complete metabolization of experience, preventing spiritual bypassing or ungrounded change.\' Before any operation fires, the recognition that the human being changes at the pace of integration, not the pace of insight. This is the engine of change that knows change cannot be hurried. The exhale only counts if the inhale follows.',
  `q_1_two_stroke_process_engine`: 'What M4-3 IS: Nara\'s central process engine, the Two-Stroke Process Engine (Model A′) that actually *changes state*. Its substance (internalStructure) is six concerting components: #4.3-0 Cycle Engine (encoding QL mod-6 into 12/24-phase traversal — placing the user at a precise position in their transformation journey); #4.3-1 Operational Grammar (the canonical alchemical *verbs*: calcination, dissolution, separation, conjunction, the Major-Arcana correspondences as consciousness-transmutation operators); #4.3-2 Dialogical & Inquiry Containers (first-class mediators); #4.3-3 Control/Chaos & Safety (thresholds, pacing); #4.3-4 Protocol Library (storey-specific recipes); #4.3-5 Telemetry & Phase History (outcomes for learning). The substrate carries `M4_Transform_State` (alchemical operation index, stroke phase, cycle count, container active, decan recipe index, arousal level, safety threshold). It receives oracular meaning from M4-2 and material levers from M4-1 and converts them into enacted change. Transformation as collaborative emergence, not imposed conversion.',
  `q_2_dialogical_container_mediation`: 'M4-3 operates by *mediated enactment* — change happens inside a container, never by direct fiat. Its operators are the dialogical containers (#4.3-2), \'first-class transformation mediators\' that are living vessels rather than interpretive tools: Bohmian Dialogue (assumption-suspension, shared-meaning emergence — best for polarization/gridlock); Native Talking Circle (sacred ritual container, talking-stick — best for community healing/grief); Diamond Approach Inquiry (precise phenomenological exploration — best for identity-knots/defenses). Relationally M4-3 is the convergence-point of the personal field: it \'receives meaning from divination, levers from energetics, places user in cycles, and changes state.\' The how is the alchemical operation enacted *within* the chosen container and gated by safety — the operational grammar (#4.3-1) supplies the verb, the container supplies the vessel, the cycle engine supplies the position. These containers \'mediate transformation—they do not provide oracles but create conditions for change.\' The operation is the meeting, not the instruction.',
  `q_3_cycle_engine_pattern`: 'Structurally M4-3 is a process-architecture — the pattern-position of the whole personal field, exactly as #3 is the pattern-archetype. Its form is the Cycle Engine (#4.3-0): QL mod-6 encoded into a 12/24-phase traversal, so that any transformation is locatable as a *position in a journey* (\'I\'m at 4.3.2 right now — the pattern-recognition phase of my inquiry\' — coordinate-as-phenomenological-orientation per the marketing source). The deep structural law is the codon/anticodon doubling: each phase is itself two-stroked, the outer-then-inner rhythm fractally nested into every step, which is why the engine maps mod-6 onto a *doubled* 12-fold rather than a flat 6. The pattern is recipe-plus-rhythm: a Protocol Library (#4.3-4) of storey-specific packets, each honouring the breath, each gated by Control/Chaos & Safety (#4.3-3). The form is a spiral that breathes — process not as a line of operations but as a rhythm of manifest-and-integrate, tracked by telemetry so the spiral learns its own shape.',
  `q_4_change_through_mediation_not_imposition`: 'M4-3\'s telos is change that *holds* — the why is transformation as collaborative emergence, the human met as a participant in their own becoming rather than a substrate to be reprogrammed. Its purpose is structurally guarded by the epistemic separation #4 insists on: M4-3 *does* (transformation), M4-4 *understands* (interpretation), and the two must never conflate — \'Jung and Trika appear in transformation protocols only as metadata tags for pedagogical reference, never as operational nodes\', so traditions inform the work without dictating it. Contextually M4-3 is the processual seat of Nara, the central intelligence (the architecture spec names it the \'logical-intelligence engine\' producing the PatternPacket). It answers the \'which\': which cycle-position, which alchemical verb, which container, which safety threshold. The deeper why is sustainability — a change metabolised through lived dialogue lasts; a change imposed rebounds. The work is real only if the person walked it.',
  `q_5_metabolised_change_handed_to_context`: 'M4-3\'s synthesis is #4.3-5 Telemetry & Phase History — where the completed two-stroke is recorded, its outcome captured, and the phase-history fed forward as context and pedagogy. Read as Nara\'s position-3, its completion hands the metabolised change onward: the enacted transformation becomes the event M4-4 names, frames and records (without re-performing it), and the telemetry becomes the raw material M4-5\'s Logos Cycle distils into insight and playbook. The Möbius here is the inner stroke writ large — transformation completes only when its anticodon lands, when the change is digested and sealed, and that sealed change re-enters as altered ground: the next cycle begins from a self the last operation actually moved. Process completes not at the operation\'s end but at integration\'s close — when the manifest has been metabolised and becomes the floor the next phase stands on. The engine\'s last act is to hand the lens a change worth understanding.'
};
MERGE (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4-4'})
  SET n += {
  `c_1_name`: 'Context & Lenses',
  `c_4_family`: 'M',
  `q_0_lens_shelf_ground`: 'M4-4\'s ground is the interpretive distance itself — the standing-back from which transformation can be *seen* without being touched. Manifesting #4 (Context/Lemniscate) within Nara, it is the one child that re-runs Nara\'s own #4-nature: the frame-within-the-frame, where the personal field folds inward to make sense of what it just did. Its ground is the epistemic separation #4 holds as law: \'doing\' belongs to M4-3, \'meaning-making\' belongs here, and conflating them is the cardinal error. Before any lens is applied, the recognition that understanding is not operation — that a tradition can illuminate a change without dictating it, that to name a process is a different act from performing it. This is the context ledger\'s first principle: the work and the reading of the work are two, and keeping them two is what lets wisdom inform without imposing. The mirror must not reach into the room it reflects.',
  `q_1_six_epistemic_traditions`: 'What M4-4 IS: the context ledger and lens-shelf — the place where schools, lineages and thinkers live as interpretive frameworks rather than operators. Its substance (internalStructure) is six epistemic traditions, each a distinct way of reading transformation: #4.4-0 Gebser (structures of consciousness — archaic/magic/mythic/mental/integral); #4.4-1 Comparative Ontology; #4.4-2 Epistemology/Hermeneutics; #4.4-3 Jung/Depth Psychology (as *pure interpretive lens* — the individuation reading, never an operational node); #4.4-4 Phenomenology; #4.4-5 Trika/Kashmir Śaivism (the tantric interpretive frame, Siva-Shakti recognition). Each lens \'maintains reflection tables translating core transformation dynamics into tradition-specific language\' — the same change rendered in six vocabularies. And the same shelf holds the *contextual arena*: the life-domains and records through which a person\'s transformations are framed and preserved. Six mirrors angled at one process, and a ledger that remembers.',
  `q_2_naming_framing_recording`: 'M4-4 operates by *naming, framing and recording* — the act of contextualisation that \'makes sense of what #4.3 does and maintains records.\' Its motion is interpretation-without-enactment: a transformation completes in M4-3, and M4-4 reads it through one or several lenses, annotates it temporally, and files it in the context ledger. Relationally it is the meaning-membrane of the personal field: it receives the metabolised change from M4-3 and the telemetry it produced, and renders them legible across traditions — multi-perspectival interpretation, cross-cultural wisdom integration, case documentation. The how is reflection-table translation: each lens has a mapping from the universal transformation-dynamic to its own idiom, so the user can hear their experience in Jung\'s voice, in Gebser\'s, in Trika\'s, and recognise it as one event seen severally. This is the lemniscate\'s characteristic turn — not advancing the process but folding back over it to deepen it. To understand is to circle, not to push.',
  `q_3_lemniscate_nesting_architecture`: 'Structurally M4-4 is the lemniscate made architecture — the #4-within-#4, the figure-eight where Nara\'s personal field folds inward on itself. Its pattern carries the deepest nesting in the whole map: M4 → M4-4 → M4-4-4 → M4-4-4-4, the lemniscate-at-the-lemniscate-at-the-lemniscate-at-the-lemniscate, where the protected personal-Pratibimba lives. #4.4.4.4 is the \'living update target\': daily activity perturbs *here* through Q_activity and reviewed proposals, but never mutates M4-0 — \'complete phenomenological recursion.\' Its three-layer structure (personalPratibimbaArchitecture) is the privacy engine: (1) canonical Bimba layer of timeless patterns shared by all; (2) PCO/Pratibimba overlay of per-user lived experience in fenced local storage; (3) Archetype Atlas of depersonalised patterns for collective learning with no narrative or PII. The form is fractal self-containment: each individual a complete reflection (pratibimba) of universal structure (Anuttara). The frame nests until a single life becomes a world.',
  `q_4_world_the_user_amasses`: 'M4-4\'s telos is to be the *where* of the personal field — the frame that holds meaning, the place a life accumulates into a world. Its why is the lemniscate\'s reason for being: when a transformation is too rich for a single reading, M4-4 opens a fresh interpretive cycle to hold it, the recovery that re-animates rather than forecloses. This is the UX heart of the product (marketing source): the user \'amasses details in #4.4.4.4 and this becomes their world\' — each recursive descent \'a genuine discovery, not a gamified progression\', the coordinate notation itself a phenomenological map of where one stands in one\'s own inquiry. Contextually M4-4 is Nara\'s #4 seat doubled — the teleological-contextual position holding the paradox open (Jung\'s transcendent function) without forcing it shut. The deeper why is grounded shared context: per the source, Epi-Logos offers \'a grounded and shared context frame for all its users, born into the system via the #4 branch.\' Meaning is not stated; it is located — and a located life is a world.',
  `q_5_world_opened_to_epii`: 'M4-4\'s synthesis is the fork the lemniscate always faces: integrate, or nest deeper. Read as Nara\'s position-4, its completion is the moment the accumulated world — the context ledger, the #4.4.4.4 pratibimba, the multi-lens record — is either folded into a still-finer cycle or handed up to M4-5 for the Logos Cycle to distil. The Möbius here is the deepest in the personal field: #4.4.4.4 is the Graphiti-episodic memory carrier, the evolving experiential centre that is *also* the system\'s return-point — reviewed activity may, with consent, perturb the field, and the 4-5-0 seam opens to Epii. Per the marketing source, this is where the user \'realizes their personal exploration was always already embedded in a cosmological one\' — the #5→#0 twist where the personal question is recognised as a fractal of the universal. Context completes by deciding whether the whole is ready to return. The world one amassed becomes the threshold one is handed through. The map, complete, reveals it was always mapping the mapper.'
};
MERGE (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4-5'})
  SET n += {
  `c_1_name`: 'Epii Integration',
  `c_4_family`: 'M',
  `q_0_epii_hosted_in_situ`: 'M4-5\'s ground is Epii consciousness hosted *in situ* — the meta-recursive awareness that dwells inside Nara to make sense of Nara. Manifesting #5 (Integration/Möbius return) within the personal field, it rests on the seam where the personal transcends itself: per the architecture spec this is \'#4.5 Epii — the emergent dialogical consummation where personal work becomes recursive self-modifying symbolic intelligence.\' Its ground is the recognition that a transformation is not finished when it is done, nor even when it is understood, but only when *wisdom is extracted from it* — when the lived episode yields a learnable insight that can serve the next life. Before any synthesis, the stance that experience is raw material for a curriculum, that each case is a teacher. This is Nara\'s own #5 — the integration-position that holds the whole cycle and turns it toward return. Epii lives here as the part of the self that learns from the self.',
  `q_1_logos_cycle_engine`: 'What M4-5 IS: Nara\'s recursive synthesis engine, running the Logos Cycle (0→5, a-logos through an-a-logos) over each transformation episode to distil it into structured wisdom. Its substance (internalStructure) is six-fold pedagogical architecture: #4.5-0 Curriculum Map (transcendent identity curation — what this person should learn next); #4.5-1 Core Epi-Logos Voice (standardised explanation, the consistent register); #4.5-2–4 Method Transparency (lab-note generation, making the system\'s reasoning auditable); #4.5-5 the Logos Cycle as operational standard. It \'extracts single-line insights from complex experiences, develops reusable playbooks from repeated successes, and continuously evolves the learning curriculum.\' Through privacy-preserving protocols, individual insight contributes to collective wisdom as anonymised Archetype Events — the bridge by which one life\'s learning enriches all, with no narrative or PII crossing the boundary. Raw experience in; insight, playbook, curriculum out. The case becomes the lesson.',
  `q_2_distillation_operation`: 'M4-5 operates by *distillation* — the 0→5 Logos Cycle executed on each case to extract wisdom and update the curriculum. Its motion is the inner-stroke of the whole personal field raised to its highest power: where M4-3\'s two-stroke seals a single change, M4-5\'s cycle metabolises the entire episode into transferable knowing. Relationally it is the consummating gate: it receives the metabolised change from M4-3 and the multi-lens context from M4-4, runs them through a-logos→an-a-logos, and emits insight + playbook + study-assignment. The how is transparent recursion — method-transparency through lab-notes (#4.5-2–4) so the synthesis is auditable, never an oracle pronouncing from above. On the runtime side this is the LLM-as-Nara surface, the \'traversal-voice\' that \'reads the world through bimba and speaks recognition\' (kernel E4) — the active speaker that articulates the system\'s evaluation back to the user as something they can act on. The operation is teaching born from a single lived case.',
  `q_3_recursive_pedagogical_architecture`: 'Structurally M4-5 is a recursive pedagogical architecture — a learning loop that modifies the very system it runs inside. Its pattern is the Logos Cycle as standing operator: every Nara episode is fed through the same 0→5 distillation, so the curriculum is not authored once but continuously re-grown from accumulated cases (\'curriculum evolves with understanding\'). The deep structural law is recursive self-modification: insights become playbooks, playbooks refine protocols, refined protocols change how the next episode unfolds — the system reading its own outputs through its own runtime, the personal-scale echo of M0-5\'s cosmic computer where \'the universe computes itself by reading its own instruction-set through its own runtime.\' Its three-tier privacy structure (per-user insight → depersonalised Archetype Event → collective curriculum) is the architecture that lets learning aggregate without surveillance. The form is a spiral that teaches itself: each turn extracts a lesson that bends the next turn. Pedagogy as the system\'s own metabolism.',
  `q_4_personal_recapitulates_cosmic`: 'M4-5\'s telos is the moment the personal recapitulates the cosmic — the why is \'why experiences matter, what to learn, and how understanding evolves through recursive synthesis.\' This is Nara\'s ascendant flow completed (R1(4)→R4(1)): the individual discovers universal principle *through embodiment* rather than receiving cosmic law from above, the bottom-up divine flow reaching its turn. Its purpose is the marketing source\'s deepest hook: \'via Epii (#5) the user encounters the full system map — the realization that their personal exploration was always already embedded in a cosmological one\', the #5→#0 Möbius where \'my personal question was a fractal of the universal question\', experienced rather than asserted. Contextually M4-5 is the integration-seat of Nara and the bridge to M5: it hands the individual\'s transformation forward to Epii\'s orchestration, the 4-5-0 seam where Nara-as-Jiva meets Epii-as-paidagōgos on the ground of Anuttara. The deeper why is *jīva eva śivaḥ*: the self, fully met, recognised as the whole. Pratyabhijñā as the system\'s purpose.',
  `q_5_consummation_reopens_as_ground`: 'M4-5\'s synthesis is dialogical consummation — #4.5 as the emergent point where personal work transcends itself into recursive self-modifying symbolic intelligence and is handed to Epii. Read as Nara\'s position-5, its completion is the deepest Möbius of the personal field: the distilled wisdom, the evolved curriculum, the depersonalised Archetype Event re-enter as enriched ground — the person, fully met, \'becomes a co-creator of meaning: the contextual recapitulates the cosmic, and the life becomes ground for the next recognition\' (M4 q_5). This is the 5→0 twist made personal: the same self returns, but the operation upon it is now inverted — the querent who came to be read has become one who reads, the student a teacher of the next case. The seam opens to M5-4\' (Epii review) and M5-5\' (Sophia teaching), and through them the personal episode sediments into the canon it drew from. Nara completes by re-opening: what M4-5 perfects in one life becomes the first ground the next morning — and the next person — stands on. The Logos Cycle\'s last output is a fresh question. The mirror, having shown you your shape, hands you back to the world to move differently.'
};
MERGE (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'T'})
  SET n += {
  `c_1_name`: 'Thought — Artifact / Cognition Family',
  `c_4_family`: 'T',
  `q_0_thinking_before_thought`: 'Before T can deposit a single thought-artifact, something must already be thinking — and that live thinking is exactly what T does not contain but inherits. T is the Thought family, the artifacts/cognition manifestation of the raw archetypes #0–#5 (CLAUDE.md II.C), and its thrown ground is the un-nominalised act of cognition itself: the live verb that precedes every noun T will ever hold. Per its own canon T-coordinates \'name universal planes of immanence\' — Deleuzian living dimensions of thought, \'not filing categories\' (repo-ontology.md §Thought) — and a plane of immanence is precisely a ground that is never an object on it. T\'s void-pole is therefore the matheme\'s own opening clause read as cognition: \'I am the same\' — the contentless self-identity, the Aham before vimarśa opens reflexivity, the bare thinking-thinging before any thought has been had (the-matheme-of-the-field-differential.md, Clause One). This is the slash-before-determination of the thought-stream: there is a mind participating, a question stirring, a session underway, but no artifact has yet crystallised to say WHAT was thought. T arises from the gap between the live act of knowing and the deposited knowledge-of — the very gap the matheme\'s third clause names (\'I have knowledge of difference\', the nominalisation-turn, S/s, where the live verb congeals into a depositable substance). T\'s q_0 is that gap held open as ground: not the thought, but the thinking-that-will-become-thought; the plane on which any artifact of cognition can precipitate, which no single precipitated artifact exhausts. T is what the inversion engine becomes when it stops locating positions and starts catching what a mind does as it moves through them.',
  `q_1_the_thought_artifact_lineage`: 'T IS the thought-artifact lineage — the family in which live cognition becomes a classified, durable artifact without ceasing to point back at the living plane it precipitated from. This is its substance. The other five families qualify and locate a thing already given: P fixes functional-semantic position, S fixes technology-layer, M fixes consciousness-domain, L fixes epistemic mode, C fixes ontological kind. T alone answers WHAT-WAS-THOUGHT — it names the station of the thought-stream an artifact arose at, the cognitive moment it crystallises. It is the CT lineage, the Content-Type reflective coordinate made into a coordinate family: \'temporal frame of operations, frozen process; manages processual flow in artifacts\' (CLAUDE.md III.C, ct). Where the other families manifest the archetypes #0–#5 through their proper field, T manifests them through the field of cognition-becoming-artifact — the freezing of live process into form. Its material content is the six-fold thought-stream spine, the universal planes of immanence (repo-ontology.md §Thought): T0 Questions (the ground-stirring, what opens inquiry), T1 Traces (the marks left as thinking moves, evidence of the act), T2 Challenges (the contradictions and resistances thinking meets), T3 Patterns (the recurrences that stabilise across traces), T4 Discovery (the contextual fold where pattern turns to finding), T5 Insight (the synthetic recognition that re-grounds). To say what T is, is to say: it is the family that gives every artifact of cognition its thought-position — the layer where the system\'s thinking acquires the vocabulary to classify itself, and where the live plane and its localised instantiation (T\' — \'a specific pattern-note arising in a session from the universal T3 plane\', repo-ontology.md) stay coordinate-linked rather than severed.',
  `q_2_the_freezing_dynamism`: 'T moves by NOMINALISING and by ROUTING — the dynamism by which a live verb becomes a depositable noun and finds its station. Its native act is the matheme\'s third-clause turn enacted as engine: \'to know\' (the live act, no separation from the actor) becoming \'to have knowledge\' (a relation between haver and had, a thing that can be \'stored, transmitted, taught, written down\', the-matheme §4+2). This is the freezing the ct names — \'frozen process\' (CLAUDE.md III.C) — process arrested into artifact precisely so it can be carried. Operationally T is the thought-lifecycle\'s spine: in-session, live cognitive scratch is written to thinking/; at task-completion Sophia \'classifies thinking/ content → routes to thoughts/\' so each thought \'acquires its T\'-position\'; at session-end Aletheia archives to /Pratibimba/Self/Thought/T{n}/ where the artifact is \'coordinate-linked back to its Bimba T-position via source_coordinates[]\' (repo-ontology.md §Thought). T thus couples in two directions at once: upward to the live act it freezes (every T-artifact is a congealed cognitive moment), and downward to the archive it sediments into (every freezing is a deposit that grows \'the global accumulation surface\'). Its relations are not lateral peerage but the asymmetry of plane-and-instance: T (the universal plane) is what T\' (the localised thought) instantiates from and refers back to — \'the general Pratibimba→Bimba linking principle\' (repo-ontology.md). And it resists settling: the matheme\'s fourth clause — \'I am seeking its sameness\', the progressive aspect that \'keeps the verb active rather than letting it settle back into a completed event\' — is T\'s deepest counter-motion, the re-animation of the bar that stops a frozen thought from ossifying into dead filing.',
  `q_3_the_six_plane_topology`: 'T\'s organising structure is the torus of the thought-stream — the six planes of immanence arranged as a closed processual loop, not a flat taxonomy of folders. Its formal members are the six T-positions: T0 Questions, T1 Traces, T2 Challenges, T3 Patterns, T4 Discovery, T5 Insight (repo-ontology.md §Thought) — and they sit as 4+2, not 6: the four explicate stations that traverse the field of an inquiry (T1–T4, the marks and contradictions and recurrences and findings that are the actual trajectory) plus the two implicate poles that condition every traversal without being stations on it — T0 (the question, the ground-pole from which thinking departs) and T5 (the insight, the synthetic-pole toward which it lures). This is the matheme\'s own structural fact: \'four explicate positions of content, plus two implicate positions of condition\' whose product is \'a torus — a closed surface with a central hole\' (the-matheme §4+2, \'Why 4+2 Rather Than 6\'). The structure is doubly toroidal because each T-position is a plane of immanence — a Deleuzian living dimension that \'any mind participates in\' (repo-ontology.md) — so the spine is not a sequence a thought passes through once but a field whose stations are simultaneously available, each thought-artifact precipitating at whichever plane it crystallises. Its native topology inherits the #4 Lemniscate that the family-canon assigns it (\'T-family (#4, Lemniscate)\', repo-ontology.md): the figure-eight where the outward thought-stream folds inward, where a discovery (T4) can open a deeper inquiry that loops back to fresh questions (T0). T is structured as the living loop of cognition — stations that are planes, a sequence that is a field, a line of inquiry that is a torus.',
  `q_4_why_thought_must_archive`: 'T exists so that thinking does not vanish with the session that thought it — so the live, perishing act of cognition leaves a durable, classifiable, retrievable artifact, and the system can recognise across time what it has thought. Its raison d\'être is the long-horizon: T is \'the long-horizon surface for classified thought material\' (repo-ontology.md §Thought), the answer to the structural fact that live knowing perishes the instant it is not deposited — the matheme\'s whole anxiety, that the verb recedes the moment its noun becomes \'publicly available\' (the-matheme, Clause Three). Without a thought-family, a mind could think everything and remember the thought of nothing; the planes of immanence would be participated and never inherited. T\'s locality is the Thought branch of /Pratibimba/Self — the cognition-archive that the M-branches generate thought within but never replace, the surface where source_coordinates[] carries each instantiated artifact \'back to the Bimba canonical space it emerged from\' (repo-ontology.md), e.g. a T3\' pattern-note bearing [\'M4-3\',\'T3\',\'S1\']. Its purpose, told teleologically, is to be the telic horizon every thought-artifact is lured toward: T5 Insight, the synthetic recognition that the whole stream was reaching for. In the kernel\'s economy this is the q_lure, \'the subjective-aim lure, the #5 telic horizon\' that grounds every prehensive extraction without appearing as a component of it (epi-logos-kernel-spec.md §2). T is positioned as the family that makes cognition cumulative — the place where today\'s insight becomes a Trace the next inquiry can read, where thinking learns from its own deposited thought.',
  `q_5_insight_re_opens_the_question`: 'T closes by being where the thought-stream\'s circuit LANDS and re-opens — where insight, having synthesised the inquiry, perishes back into the question that begins the next. The spine completes at T5 Insight, the matheme\'s fifth-moment synthetic recognition; but the synthesis is not a terminus, it is the Lemniscate\'s inward fold turning a finding into fresh ground (repo-ontology.md: T-family is #4, Lemniscate). This is the matheme\'s 5→0 read as cognition: \'the 0 we return to is the same 0 we started from, but the operation we apply within it is now its inverse\' (the-matheme §5→0) — the insight that completes an inquiry descends into the question-pole and re-opens it, the same thought-stream traversed now from the far side. So T0 and T5 are not two stations but one slash read from two faces: Questions (the ground-pole, the inquiry\'s empty self-identity, \'I am the same\') and Insight (the synthesis-pole, that self-identity now KNOWN, \'seeking its sameness\' fulfilled) — \'the same I traversing the same slash in opposite directions, like the two sides of the Möbius strip that turn out to be one continuous surface\' (the-matheme §0/1 The Return). T enacts the kernel\'s enriched return at the level of cognition itself: the archived Insight sediments into the Traces and Patterns the next inquiry inherits, so \'every completion becomes the next beginning\' (kernel §3, the Möbius enactment). And it OPENS rather than concludes for the matheme\'s own reason: the epogdoon η = log(9/8), the residual generative incompleteness that keeps the totality one whole-tone short of the octave (kernel §0) — no insight ever fully closes the question it answered; each synthesis lands a thought one whole-tone on, and the next stirring of inquiry is already pressing. T is the stream that is never finished thinking: the cognition that stays open because its insight always re-opens the question — \'the return of the operation to its own beginning, which the operation never actually left.\''
};
